&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer – Applied AI &amp;amp; Streaming&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aliso Viejo, CA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;We think AI will change what cloud gaming can be. It can make streamed play faster, more personal, and more accessible, and in some ways better than playing locally. As a Senior Software Engineer on our team, you&#39;ll build agents and inference-backed systems into a real-time streaming platform and ship them to players. You&#39;ll work where AI meets performance-sensitive systems, and a lot of the problems here are still being defined.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, prototype, and ship AI-powered capabilities across our streaming platform and player experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply inference and agents to real-time performance, player engagement, personalization, and accessibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to understand, optimize, and evolve large existing codebases, including our streaming stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and extend our platform in C++, and help shape the technologies and architecture we use next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build what production AI needs: evaluation, telemetry, guardrails, fallbacks, and attention to latency and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous ideas into demos and experiments, measure what works, and harden it for production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work AI-natively every day, using coding agents, automation, and rapid exploration, and help the team do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a small, focused engineering team and with partners across streaming, platform, and cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re a great fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A BS in Computer Science or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior-level software engineering experience with a track record of owning complex systems end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong C++ skills from professional work in production codebases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and deploying agents or AI-powered features in production. You&#39;ve worked through evals, regressions, latency, cost, and the ways these systems fail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong grasp of how to turn models into products, including context and prompt design, tool use and orchestration, memory and retrieval, model selection, and where inference should run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI-native engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product judgment. You can tell when AI makes an experience better and when it&#39;s a gimmick.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work in ambiguity, move quickly, and keep momentum as priorities change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication, strong ownership, and a habit of making the people around you better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus XP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, Rust, or other languages used to build and serve AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-latency or on-device inference, model optimization, or GPU experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-time media, game streaming, graphics, or video experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud infrastructure, distributed systems, or production platform experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building conversational or agentic experiences for games or interactive products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux or Windows systems experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Japanese language or cross-cultural collaboration experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy playing video games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on AI problems most engineers never get to. In real-time systems, every millisecond counts, and so does every inference call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help set the direction. Our AI strategy is still taking shape, and you&#39;ll help decide what we build, not just how.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get real ownership. You&#39;ll join a small, senior team where ideas go from prototype to production quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
